  "description": "A resilient, observable, secure-by-default HTTP API client framework for enterprise .NET: fluent requests, API key / bearer / OAuth2 client-credentials authentication, default-on retry and circuit breaking, pagination as IAsyncEnumerable, response caching, correlation IDs, OpenTelemetry-ready tracing and metrics, and normalized RFC 9457-aware errors — all composed on HttpClientFactory.",
